~ start

if Global.offered_dumplings == true
	if Global.minigame_success == true
		Pig: Well I guess all those years of practice paid off!
	else:
		Pig: How can this be even worse than I imagined?
	set Global.offered_dumplings = false
	=> END

Cat: Who are you?
Cat: You…You smell like the Rat! How dare you come near me!

~ main_menu
- I don't mean no harm. I’m just looking for the Horse.
	Cat: The Horse? I saw them run ahead...If you have no other business, then quickly leave. 
	Cat: I have no desire to smell more of the Rat than I need to. Not after they…Nevermind. Just leave!
	=> main_menu
- What is your issue with the Rat?
	Cat: My issue? Do you know why Rat even won the race? Resourcefulness? Adaptiveness? No! 
	Cat: It’s because they tricked me, promising to wake me up for the race, but forgot about me! 
	Cat: We were best friends…I’m sure the Rat knew that there wasn't enough space for all of us and one of us had to go…
	
	- I'm sorry
	
	Cat: Whatever. It’s been thousands of years. Did you see the Rat before coming here?
	
	- Yes, I was asking for advice. Rat told me to hire resources to help me manage my family business, so that I can explore my life...
	- ...but I’m not sure if I can trust them…
	
	Cat: ...
	Cat: Sigh…You probably expected me to say don’t trust them. Then, you’ll agree and go back to your family business right?
	Cat: I hate to admit this but…don’t let fear or hate guide you. I’ve been hateful for too long and I’m sure a deep part of you holds resentment for the past 500-years of constant pressure. 
	Cat: Sometimes…sometimes it’s time to let go and move on. The only one you’re harming for being hateful is yourself. 
	Cat: Just look at me, all alone and so far away from the Palace...
	
	- I think Rat was looking for you nearby. They seemed sorrowful.
	Cat:..Just leave. The Horse should be ahead.
	=> main_menu

- Offer dumplings
	Cat: ...Thanks. I’ll have {{GameManager.get_ingredients()}} dumplings please.
	set Global.offered_dumplings = true
	do Global.start_dumplings_minigame()
	=> END
- Walk away
	Cat: Typical...
	=> END
=> END